    "confidence": "interpreted",
    "note": "Cumulative ladder: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 'Best Seat in the House' refunds 1 SP after the first Skill — a Skill-Point change with no buff id and no single canonical event, so documented not asserted (it does shift the whole rotation). E2 'Jailbreaking Rainbowwalk': battle-start Energy Regeneration Rate +25% for 3 turns (tb_harm_e2 err 0.25). E3 'Sanatorium for Rest Notes' Skill+2/Talent+2 raise 'Halftime (main)'/'Halftime (extra)' 0.5 -> 0.55. E4 'Dove in Tophat' gives teammates +15% of the Trailblazer's Break Effect (tb_harm_e4; the magnitude is derived from live BE, so only presence is asserted). E5 'Poem Favors Rhythms of Old' Ult+2/Basic+1 raise 'Swing Dance Etiquette' 1 -> 1.1. E6 'Tomorrow, Rest in Spotlight' adds +2 Skill DMG applications, raising the 'Halftime (extra)' hit count 6 -> 24. Fixtures run one battle per rank e0..e6."
